        <activityName xml:lang="en">Blade server, at data center</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Blade server, at data center
The blade server contains various electronic components and hardware; UUID: 63d6114e-911c-3e41-913c-94e17e0b6712
The dataset is an average of two blade servers in Switzerland and Germany. One of which is HP ProLiant BL460c Gen8.
Location: Typical blade servers.
Technology: Blade servers used in the data centers.
Time period: Unspecified
Production volume: unknown
Sampling: Literature &amp; own estimations
Extrapolations: Average technology
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_63d6114e-911c-3e41-913c-94e17e0b6712.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
